.ie \n(.g .ds Aq \(aq
.el .ds Aq '
.TH scan 1 0.2.2 https://github.com/dbowm91/cargo-cleanme "General Commands Manual"
.SH NAME
scan \- Reconcile the machine read\-only: full by default, explicit with ROOT, routine inventory with `\-\-known`
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBscan\fR [\fB\-\-known\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] [\fIROOT\fR] 
.SH DESCRIPTION
Reconcile the machine read\-only: full by default, explicit with ROOT, routine inventory with `\-\-known`
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-known\fR
Routine read\-only inventory over the maintenance scope
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.TP
[\fIROOT\fR]
Optional bounded root. Makes the scan Explicit and bypasses configured ignore/unignore filters
